  <diagram id="overview" name="Neoantimon2 — recognize the files and records">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="8" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="920" figureTitle="Neoantimon2 — recognize the files and records" figureDescription="Independent synthetic snippets. Patient/sample mapping and HLA examples are declarations, not one linked biological case. Valid single-sample tab-separated VCF syntax is shown. References are versioned external resources. Output examples use the official synthetic Quick Start: chr1:4 G&gt;A, transcript TA, KPK test peptide and HLA-A*02:01, NOT_RUN/NOT_GRADED. No biological or clinical validation is asserted." syntheticVcf="##fileformat=VCFv4.2&#10;##FORMAT=&lt;ID=GT,Number=1,Type=String,Description=&quot;Genotype&quot;&gt;&#10;#CHROM&#09;POS&#09;ID&#09;REF&#09;ALT&#09;QUAL&#09;FILTER&#09;INFO&#09;FORMAT&#09;S1&#10;chr1&#09;4&#09;.&#09;G&#09;A&#09;.&#09;PASS&#09;.&#09;GT&#09;0/1">
